{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Find Her&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/70140502c79ebae4941371a1e399a1c7.poster.avif?t=1768750103\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/70140502c79ebae4941371a1e399a1c7.webm?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/70140502c79ebae4941371a1e399a1c7.mp4?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To the boy <strong>Nero</strong>, the girl <strong>Snoa</strong> was the only one who had always been by his side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then one day, a world shaking calamity strikes, and Snoa vanishes without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nero is left alone in a world crawling with colossal beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the missing Snoa, Nero begins a journey across this unfamiliar and dangerous world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Run to Stay Alive&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/f2eb3519728dde675ee1106f1ac04891.poster.avif?t=1768750103\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/f2eb3519728dde675ee1106f1ac04891.webm?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/f2eb3519728dde675ee1106f1ac04891.mp4?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is filled with massive forms and creatures that move in unsettling ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment they catch you, Nero disappears without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid relentless threats, you must hide, leap, and roll forward to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Push Through the Blocked Path&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/02f83f1494a3bb49037d1010fe487de4.poster.avif?t=1768750103\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/02f83f1494a3bb49037d1010fe487de4.webm?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/02f83f1494a3bb49037d1010fe487de4.mp4?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal beings are not the only obstacles in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh terrain and deadly mechanisms stand in Nero\u2019s way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings and manipulate objects,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >clearing puzzles to carve your own path forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Face the Transcendent Horror&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/b93b14f9b5d62ad0e8f3063b13144c89.poster.avif?t=1768750103\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/b93b14f9b5d62ad0e8f3063b13144c89.webm?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/b93b14f9b5d62ad0e8f3063b13144c89.mp4?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Transcendents who rule this world are fear incarnate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment Nero confronts them, death is inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet through an unknown power, he is reborn within a subspace where their hearts lie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the structures protecting the heart,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and absorb it to gain new movement abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Unanswered Questions&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/5872be6fa8f45206e6814ae7e91e756f.poster.avif?t=1768750103\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/5872be6fa8f45206e6814ae7e91e756f.webm?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/5872be6fa8f45206e6814ae7e91e756f.mp4?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are they, really.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the mysterious power Nero has obtained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And where is Snoa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the journey deepens, the hidden truths of this world slowly come into view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whatever awaits you\u2026 keep moving forward.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450900?t=1768750103","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/c760190239ba1e0550f1b7ea6b19975b8b63e573/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768750103","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/76879cfeabf7a011eec178ae285fd835abea5c6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768750103","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/76879cfeabf7a011eec178ae285fd835abea5c6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768750103","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3491210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Notice</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/9e20c5f2006feb67ae9331c33267e4e4.avif?t=1768750103\" width=1366 height=239 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Find Her&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/70140502c79ebae4941371a1e399a1c7.poster.avif?t=1768750103\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/70140502c79ebae4941371a1e399a1c7.webm?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/70140502c79ebae4941371a1e399a1c7.mp4?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To the boy <strong>Nero</strong>, the girl <strong>Snoa</strong> was the only one who had always been by his side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then one day, a world shaking calamity strikes, and Snoa vanishes without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nero is left alone in a world crawling with colossal beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the missing Snoa, Nero begins a journey across this unfamiliar and dangerous world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Run to Stay Alive&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/f2eb3519728dde675ee1106f1ac04891.poster.avif?t=1768750103\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/f2eb3519728dde675ee1106f1ac04891.webm?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/f2eb3519728dde675ee1106f1ac04891.mp4?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is filled with massive forms and creatures that move in unsettling ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment they catch you, Nero disappears without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid relentless threats, you must hide, leap, and roll forward to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Push Through the Blocked Path&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/02f83f1494a3bb49037d1010fe487de4.poster.avif?t=1768750103\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/02f83f1494a3bb49037d1010fe487de4.webm?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/02f83f1494a3bb49037d1010fe487de4.mp4?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal beings are not the only obstacles in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh terrain and deadly mechanisms stand in Nero\u2019s way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings and manipulate objects,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >clearing puzzles to carve your own path forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Face the Transcendent Horror&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/b93b14f9b5d62ad0e8f3063b13144c89.poster.avif?t=1768750103\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/b93b14f9b5d62ad0e8f3063b13144c89.webm?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/b93b14f9b5d62ad0e8f3063b13144c89.mp4?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Transcendents who rule this world are fear incarnate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment Nero confronts them, death is inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet through an unknown power, he is reborn within a subspace where their hearts lie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the structures protecting the heart,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and absorb it to gain new movement abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Unanswered Questions&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/5872be6fa8f45206e6814ae7e91e756f.poster.avif?t=1768750103\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/5872be6fa8f45206e6814ae7e91e756f.webm?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/5872be6fa8f45206e6814ae7e91e756f.mp4?t=1768750103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are they, really.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the mysterious power Nero has obtained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And where is Snoa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the journey deepens, the hidden truths of this world slowly come into view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whatever awaits you\u2026 keep moving forward.</strong></p>","developers":["Black Cheeze"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/e5d3e4affaeae9979f8ea056cd8f8cb335a628ae/header.jpg?t=1768750103","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3450900/2018323737/565d950f9738de161559c4f350f1973808178779/1766603829/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766618452","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3450900/2018323737/565d950f9738de161559c4f350f1973808178779/1766603829/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766618452","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3450900/2018323737/565d950f9738de161559c4f350f1973808178779/1766603829/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766618452","id":257255042,"name":"DOMSIC - Official Gameplay Trailer","thum